    "title": "Artemis II: NASA's First Crewed Lunar Flyby in 50 Years - NASA",
    "snippet": "Meet the Artemis II crew and learn how NASA's 10-day lunar flyby mission will test deep space systems and pave the way for future Moon landings.   Summarize",
